</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Wiring</strong>: Strictly follow the wire sequence to avoid damaging the board or connected components.</li>\n<li><strong>Power supply</strong>: Ensure the power supply matches the specified voltage requirements to avoid damaging the transmitter shield.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "You can combine this product with a Multi-Function Core Board to form a Cyberbrick transmitter module. By pairing a Remote Control Receiver Shield with another Multi-Function Core Board, you can create a Cyberbrick receiver module. Connect joysticks and buttons to the transmitter module, and motors or servos to the receiver module, and you will have a minimal Cyberbrick remote control car project unit.\n\nWiring: Strictly follow the wire sequence to avoid damaging the board or connected components.\n\nPower supply: Ensure the power supply matches the specified voltage requirements to avoid damaging the transmitter shield.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
